ree quota, Beijing (cn-beijing) region only: usually 1,000,000 tokens per model (input+output combined), valid 90 days from activation, model release or approval. No real-name verification is needed to get and use it. Unverified accounts are force-stopped at exhaustion; pay-as-you-go needs Chinese real-name verification. One grant per real-name identity. Two DeepSeek R1 distill models ar","base_url":"https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1","api_shape":["openai","anthropic","custom"],"auth":"Authorization: Bearer <DashScope API key, Beijing region>","signup":{"kyc":"none for the free quota; Chinese real-name verification (实名认证) required to continue pay-as-you-go","region_notes":"Needs an aliyun.com (China site) account. No card or purchase is mentioned for the free quota ('no need to claim or buy anything'). The docs read don't say whether non-Chinese phones or IDs can register. For India, use alibaba-intl (Singapore) instead. RAM sub-accounts share the quota."},"limits":{"scope":"account","other":"1M tokens per model, 90 days, one-time. Per-model RPM/TPM limits for Beijing are on the China-site rate-limit page, which wasn't cached. Earlier research: qwen3.8 dynamic TPM in Beijing is double Singapore's."},"reset":{"when":"one-time grant; expires 90 days after activation/model release/approval","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"status_page":"https://status.aliyun.com/","terms":"Aliyun China-site service terms; resale clauses not reviewed in docs read.","data_training_free_tier":"China-site FAQ (per earlier research) says data is not used for training; not re-verified today","health_probe":{"request":"GET {base}/models","auth_required":true},"sources":["https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/new-free-quota","https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/model-pricing","https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/compatibility-of-openai-with-dashscope","https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/anthropic-api-messages","https://status.aliyun.com/"],"verifi