 (Bearer key) returns the models enabled for your team","auth_required":true},"sources":["https://dev.meta.ai/docs/pricing-rate-limits","https://dev.meta.ai/docs/models","https://dev.meta.ai/docs/overview","https://dev.meta.ai/legal/geographic-use-policy","https://dev.meta.ai/help","https://llama.developer.meta.com/"],"verified_date":"2026-10-19","layers":["web-2026-10-19"],"notes":"Exclude from the free pool. Only relevant if Zero-X adds paid backends; Contributor mode is very cheap but grants Meta training rights."}},{"provider":"minimax","display_name":"MiniMax Open Platform (international platform.minimax.io + China platform.minimaxi.com)","status":"rejected","notes":"Reference record from the 19 Oct research (free_status=paid_only_now).","evidence_url":"https://platform.minimax.io/docs/guides/rate-limits","record":{"id":"minimax","name":"MiniMax Open Platform (international platform.minimax.io + China platform.minimaxi.com)","kind":"other","free_status":"paid_only_now","free_status_note":"No free LLM tier in the official docs: pay-as-you-go needs a top-up (online payment or bank transfer). The only free items are non-LLM: free audio and the first 2-5 images on H3 video, plus music '-free' models, now retired. Third-party pages claim a small one-time signup trial credit (one says ¥15, ~30 days); this isn't confirmed on any official page. MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-Preview is only in the pai","base_url":"https://api.minimax.io/v1","api_shape":["openai","anthropic"],"auth":"Authorization: Bearer <pay-as-you-go API key> (the M Plan 'Subscription Key' is a different key type for plan quota)","signup":{"kyc":"none stated for the intl platform","region_notes":"The intl platform takes online payment or bank transfer, with no country list published. The CN platform (minimaxi.com) is a separate account system. From India, api.minimax.io is served via an Akamai edge in Chennai (earlier research)."},"limits":{"scope":"account","other":"Paid per-model limits: MiniMax-M3 200 RPM / 10M TPM; M2.7, M2.5 and their highspeed variants, and M2, 500 RPM / 20M TPM (TPM = input + output). M Plan tiers (Go, Explore 3x, Build 7.5x) use 5-hour usage windows (error 2056)."},"reset":{"when":"rolling minute (RPM/TPM); M Plan 5-hour windows"},"status_page":"https://status.minimax.io/","terms":"No sublicensing, reselling or distributing the services outside your integrated applications, and no transfer of access keys.","data_training_free_tier":"No free tier; inputs and outputs may be used to improve services","health_probe":{"request":"GET https://api.minimax.io/v1/models (documented OpenAI-compatible List Models; there is also an Anthropic-format list at /anthropic/v1/models)","auth_required":true},"sources":["https://platform.minimax.io/docs/guides/rate-limits","https://platform.minimax.io/docs/guides/pricing-paygo","https://platform.minimax.io/docs/pricing/overview","https://platform.minimax.io/docs/guides/text-generation","https://platform.minimax.io/docs/faq/models","https://platform.minimax.io/docs/faq/about-account"],"verified_date":"2026-10-19","layers":["web-2026-10-19","paid-2026-10-19"],"notes":"M Plan / MiniMax Code subscription keys are meant for the listed coding tools; routing them through a public gateway would be coding-plan token reuse, so they are not recorded as a free path. MiniMax-M2.5 is also free for 90 days (1M tokens) on Alibaba Bailian Beijing (see alibaba-bailian-cn)."}},{"provider":"mistral","display_name":"Mistral AI (Studio / La Plateforme Free mode)","status":"rejected","notes":"Reference record from the 19 Oct research (free_status=active).","evidence_url":"https://docs.mistral.ai/admin/billing-usage/subscriptions","record":{"id":"mistral","name":"Mistral AI (Studio / La Plateforme Free mode)","kind":"official_free_tier","free_status":"active","free_status_note":"Free mode is the default for new accounts: API keys with no credit card, plus 'included monthly usage' shared across Vibe, Studio and API, within limits shown only in Admin > API > Limits. Today's pricing page lists no API credit amount for the Free plan; API credits are listed only for paid Pro/Education plans ($15 to $25.5/mo).","base_url":"https://api.mistral.ai/v1","api_shape":["openai","custom"],"auth":"Authorization: Bearer <MISTRAL_API_KEY>","signup":{"card_required":false,"phone_required":true,"kyc":"phone verification (see note)","region_notes":"Phone verification: Mistral help center as read on 2026-10-17/18 by earlier research, and freellm.net (third-party). Not confirmed in the docs read today. Region availability for India is not stated in the pages read."},"limits":{"scope":"org","other":"Completion limits are per model, as tokens per minute and requests per second, shown in Admin > API > Limits. Included monthly usage is shared with Vibe and Studio. When it runs out without pay-as-you-go, usage stops until the next billing period."},"reset":{"when":"monthly (included usage per billing period); RPS/TPM rolling"},"status_page":"https://status.mistral.ai/","terms":"End users of your offering are allowed; no buying, selling or transferring API keys, or giving third parties access without written authorization.","data_training_free_tier":"Yes by default; opt out in Admin > Privacy > 'Anonymous improvement data' (Labs models cannot opt out)","health_probe":{"request":"GET https://api.mistral.ai/v1/models (Bearer key)","auth_required":true},"sources":["https://docs.mistral.ai/admin/billing-usage/subscriptions","https://docs.mistral.ai/admin/billing-usage/usage-limits","https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-started/quickstarts/studio/activate-and-generate-api-key","https://docs.mistral.ai/models","https://docs.mistral.ai/models/codestral-25-08.md","https://docs.mistral.ai/models/mistral-medium-3-5-26-04.md"],"verified_date":"2026-10-19","layers":["web-2026-10-19","research-2026-10-18","paid-2026-10-19","omniroute-catalog"],"notes":"Change from earlier research: Devstral is gone (retired 2026-07-31), and Mistral now points coders to mistral-medium-3-5 and Codestral. The Codestral host is alive. The free allowance is unquantified in official docs; only the console shows it. The ToS line comes from the 2026-10-18 read."}},{"provider":"mistral","model_id":"mistral-medium-3-5","context_window":256000,"supports_tools":true,"status":"new","record":{"notes":"GA (2026-04-28). Mistral's agentic/coding model and the replacement for Devstral 2. Aliases: mistral-medium-latest, mistral-medium-3."}},{"provider":"mistral","model_id":"mistral-small-2603","context_window":256000,"supports_tools":true,"status":"new","record":{"notes":"Mistral Small 4, GA. Reasoning and coding hybrid. Alias mistral-small-latest."}},{"provider":"mistral","model_id":"mistral-large-4","context_window":1000000,"supports_tools":true,"status":"new","record":{"notes":"Public Preview since 2026-10-06; silent updates possible, 1-month deprecation notice. Docs say context '1M'."}},{"provider":"mistral","model_id":"mistral-large-2512","context_window":256000,"status":"rejected","notes":"tool calling not published","record":{"notes":"Mistral Large 3, GA."}},{"provider":"mistral","model_id":"codestral-2508","context_window":128000,"supports_tools":true,"status":"new","record":{"notes":"FIM plus chat. Alias codestral-latest. Served on api.mistral.ai; codestral.mistral.ai routes are also live."}},{"provider":"mistral","model_id":"ministral-14b-2512","context_window":256000,"status":"rejected","notes":"tool calling not published","record":{"notes":"Ministral 3 14B. 8B and 3B variants also exist."}},{"provider":"mistral","model_id":"zai-glm-5-3","context_window":1000000,"status":"rejected","notes":"tool calling not published","record":{"notes":"Z.ai GLM 5.3 hosted by Mistral (GA). Free-mode access is not verified. zai-glm-5-2 retires 2026-10-31."}},{"provider":"mixlayer","display_name":"Mixlayer","status":"rejected","notes":"Reference record from the 19 Oct research (free_status=unverified_catalog).","record":{"id":"mixlayer","name":"Mixlayer