ound to one verified entity.","data_training_free_tier":"not stated in docs","health_probe":{"request":"GET {base}/models?sub_type=chat (needs key). Per-model check: POST {base}/chat/completions model=Qwen/Qwen3-8B max_tokens=1","auth_required":true},"sources":["https://www.siliconflow.cn/pricing","https://api-docs.siliconflow.cn/docs/release-notes/overview","https://api-docs.siliconflow.cn/docs/userguide/faqs/authentication","https://api-docs.siliconflow.cn/docs/userguide/faqs/rate-limit-and-upgradation","https://api-docs.siliconflow.cn/docs/userguide/faqs/error-code","https://api-docs.siliconflow.cn/docs/api/models-get"],"verified_date":"2026-10-19","layers":["web-2026-10-19"],"notes":"Best free coding-capable model here is zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash (1M context, tools), but only for China-verified accounts. Also reachable through the docs.siliconflow.com/cn mirror."}},{"provider":"siliconflow-cn","model_id":"zai-org/GLM-5.3-Flash","context_window":1048576,"supports_tools":true,"status":"new","record":{"notes":"320B MoE (18B active), vision input, reasoning. Free at ¥0, labelled New. Limit 500 RPM / 2M TPM at every tier. Z.ai and SiliconFlow international charge for it ($0.15/$0.50 per M), so this may be a p"}},{"provider":"siliconflow-cn","model_id":"XingChenAGI/Xing4.0-29B","context_window":262144,"supports_tools":true,"status":"new","record":{"notes":"China Telecom 29B-A4B MoE, reasoning, tagged 'Vibe Coding'. Labelled New and Free. L0 limit 1000 RPM / 40K TPM. Internal targetModelName is 'teletest'; call it by the public ID."}},{"provider":"siliconflow-cn","model_id":"Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B","context_window":262144,"supports_tools":true,"status":"new","record":{"notes":"Small reasoning model with vision. L0 limit 1000 RPM / 80K TPM."}},{"provider":"siliconflow-cn","model_id":"Qwen/Qwen3-8B","context_window":131072,"supports_tools":true,"status":"new","record":{"notes":"Reasoning (thinking mode). Fixed 1000 RPM / 50K TPM."}},{"provider":"siliconflow-cn","model_id":"deepsee