Doubao) - China","kind":"trial_credit","free_status":"trial_only","free_status_note":"New accounts get a free inference quota per model, shared across the main account and visible in the console. The doc example uses 500K tokens per model. There's also a data-for-tokens 'Collaboration Reward Plan' (up to 5M tokens per model per day returned as 30-day packs), but it needs real-name verification. Most models left the plan on 2026-09-01 (31 text models incl. Doubao-Seed-2.0, DeepSeek ","base_url":"https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/v3","api_shape":["openai"],"auth":"Authorization: Bearer <Ark API Key>","signup":{"card_required":false,"phone_required":true,"kyc":"Chinese real-name verification needed to activate models once the free quota is used up, and to join the reward plan.","india_available":false,"region_notes":"Mainland China cloud. The international counterpart, BytePlus ModelArk, doesn't list India as a supported country, so Indian users have no ByteDance route."},"limits":{"scope":"account","other":"One-time free tokens per model (doc example 500K), shared across sub-accounts. Fine-tuned models share their base model's quota. Reward plan: daily return of up to 5M tokens per model (personal tier) as 30-day packs, in exchange for training-data rights."},"reset":{"when":"one-time trial; reward packs issued next day, valid 30 days","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"terms":"China mainland terms; reward plan grants ByteDance perpetual rights to your prompts and outputs.","data_training_free_tier":"Reward-plan traffic is licensed perpetually for model training; the plain trial quota is not.","health_probe":{"request":"GET {base}/models (needs key)","auth_required":true},"sources":["https://docs.volcengine.com/docs/ark/free-inference-quota?lang=zh","https://docs.volcengine.com/docs/ark/collaboration-reward-program?lang=zh"],"verified_date":"2026-10-19","layers":["web-2026-10-19","omniroute-catalog"],"notes":"Not usable from India in practice."}},{"provider":"volcengine-ark","model_id":"doubao-pro-32k","status":"rejected","notes":"tool calling not published; trial credit only","record":{"notes":"Doubao Pro 32K; one-time-initial; pool doubao; creditTokens 15000000"}},{"provider":"xai","display_name":"xAI (Grok API)","status":"rejected","notes":"Reference record from the 19 Oct research (free_status=paid_only_now).","evidence_url":"https://docs.x.ai/developers/pricing.md","record":{"id":"xai","name":"xAI (Grok API)","kind":"trial_credit","free_status":"paid_only_now","free_status_note":"No free credits or data-sharing program appear anywhere in docs.x.ai (pricing, rate limits, llms-full.txt checked 2026-10-19). Third-party blogs describe a $25 signup credit and $150/mo data-sharing credits from 2025 to early 2026. One third-party says the program has been undocumented since 2026-09-01. Check console.x.ai billing before relying on any of it.","base_url":"https://api.x.ai/v1","api_shape":["openai"],"auth":"Authorization: Bearer <xAI API key>","signup":{"card_required":true,"region_notes":"Rate-limit tier is based on prepaid credit purchases or paid invoices since 2026-01-01 (Tier 0 = $0)."},"limits":{"scope":"org","other":"Per-model RPS/TPM by spend tier (T0 = $0, T1 = $50, T2 = $250, T3 = $1,000, T4 = $5,000). Exceeding gives 429."},"reset":{},"status_page":"https://status.x.ai/","terms":"Paid API via prepaid credits or invoices.","data_training_free_tier":"n/a (no free tier); the former credit program required data sharing (third-party)","health_probe":{"request":"GET https://api.x.ai/v1/models","auth_required":true},"sources":["https://docs.x.ai/developers/pricing.md","https://docs.x.ai/developers/rate-limits.md","https://docs.x.ai/developers/models.md","https://docs.x.ai/llms-full.txt","https://toolfreebie.com/grok-api-free-credits/%20(third-party,%20via%20search)","https://aitoolsrecap.com/Blog/how-to-get-free-grok-api-credits-2026%20(third-party,%20via%20search)"],"verified_date":"2026-10-19","layers":["web-2026-10-19","paid-2026-10-19"],"notes":"Grok Build (xAI's coding agent product) has its own 'free tier' (mentioned in docs), but that is not API access. No free grok-code API promo was found."}},{"provider":"xiaomi-mimo","display_name":"Xiaomi MiMo API Open Platform (mimo.mi.com / api.xiaomimimo.com)","status":"rejected","notes":"Reference record from the 19 Oct research (free_status=paid_only_now).","evidence_url":"https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/price/pay-as-you-go","record":{"id":"xiaomi-mimo","name":"Xiaomi MiMo API Open Platform (mimo.mi.com / api.xiaomimimo.com)","kind":"other","free_status":"paid_only_now","free_status_note":"No current free LLM access. The public beta was free until billing began on 2026-01-26 16:00 UTC+8. The partner agent-framework free trials (OpenClaw/Kilo/Cline etc., ended 2026-04-02 12:00 UTC+8; Hermes Agent via Nous Portal, 2026-04-08 to 04-22) are over and were never direct-API. The referral program no longer gives sign-up credits, only 10% credit-back on a friend's paid Token Plan order. Only","base_url":"https://api.xiaomimimo.com/v1","api_shape":["openai","anthropic"],"auth":"api-key: <key> or Authorization: Bearer <key> (pay-as-you-go sk- keys; Token Plan tp- keys use a separate base URL and are not interchangeable)","signup":{"kyc":"real-name verification needed only for Chinese mainland users before top-up; others top up directly (Jan 2026 billing notice)","region_notes":"Overseas pricing is in USD. The error doc lists 403 'service not available in the current region', but no region list is published. api.xiaomimimo.com resolved to Alibaba Cloud Singapore (~166 ms TTFB from India, 2026-10-18)."},"limits":{"scope":"account","other":"Paid: mimo-v2.6-pro and mimo-v2.6-flash each 100 RPM / 10M TPM per account (summed over all keys); ultraspeed is custom. There is also a per-account model concurrency limit, with no number published."},"reset":{"when":"rolling minute"},"terms":"API user agreement not reviewed; Token Plan keys are valid only during the subscription.","data_training_free_tier":"No free tier; API data-use terms not verified","health_probe":{"request":"GET https://api.xiaomimimo.com/v1/models","auth_required":true},"sources":["https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/price/pay-as-you-go","https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/api/guidance/rate-limit","https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/api/guidance/error-codes","https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/api/guidance/model-hyperparameters","https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/api/model/list-models","https://mimo.mi.com/docs/en-US/news/previous-news/billing"],"verified_date":"2026-10-19","layers":["web-2026-10-19","research-2026-10-18","paid-2026-10-19"],"notes":"Third-party pages still advertise '$2 free credits with invite code', but the official promotions FAQ (2026-10-19) says binding a code only creates the referral relationship. A builder grant program (MiMo Orbit) gives Token Plan or credits to approved applicants, with amounts set per case. Token Plan is a subscription for coding tools, not a gateway path. In thinking mode, temperature and top_p are forced to 1.0 / 0.95."}},{"provider":"xkiro","display_name":"xKiro","status":"rejected","notes":"Reference record from the 19 Oct research (free_status=unverified_catalog).","record":{"id":"xkiro","name":"xKiro","kind":"aggregator_free_models","free_status":"unverified_catalog","base_url":"https://api.xkiro.com/v1","api_shape":"openai","auth":"api_key","signup":"Free account, no card.","limits":{"tpd":5000000,"scope":"account","other":"RPM not published"},"reset":"Daily (time not stated); 429 until reset","health_probe":{"request":"https://api.xkiro.com/v1/models","auth_required":false},"sources":[],"layers":["omniroute-catalog"],"notes":"Despite the name, OmniRoute documents it as an OpenAI-compatible gateway with Qwen/MiniMax/DeepSeek/Mistral/SenseNova free models — no evidence in OmniRoute that it proxies Kiro. hardStopGuaranteed. Public /v1/models tags access_tier=free."}},{"provider":"xkiro","model_id":"qwen/qwen3-vl-plus:free","cont