r Pricing') lists GLM-4.7-Flash, GLM-4.5-Flash and GLM-4.6V-Flash as Free for input, cached input and output, with no token cap. There is no free GLM-5.x model: GLM-5.3-Flash is paid ($0.15 in / $0.50 out per M). Warning sign: the standalone GLM-4.7-Flash guide now returns 'Page Not Found' and the API reference model enum no longer lists it, though the GLM-4.7 guide still has a ","base_url":"https://api.z.ai/api/paas/v4","api_shape":["openai","anthropic"],"auth":"Authorization: Bearer <Standard API Key> (from 16 Oct 2026, Standard and Coding Plan keys are separate key types)","signup":{"kyc":"none stated in docs","india_available":true,"region_notes":"Singapore-law terms. The only excluded regions are Iran, North Korea, Cuba, Crimea, Donetsk and Zaporizhzhia, so India is not excluded. The docs don't say whether a card or top-up is needed before free models work. The FAQ says card top-ups must not use 3DS."},"limits":{"scope":"account","other":"No token or request quota on the free models. The binding limit is per-model concurrency, shown only in the logged-in console (z.ai/manage-apikey/rate-limits). Third-party claim (toolnavs, Jan 2026): free GLM-4.7-Flash allows 1 concurrent request and about 1 RPS."},"reset":{"when":"not applicable (concurrency cap, no quota counter)"},"terms":"API may be integrated into your own apps for end users; sublicensing needs consent; Coding Plan quota may not be proxied or resold.","data_training_free_tier":"API content not used for training unless you opt in","health_probe":{"request":"POST {base}/chat/completions {model:'glm-4.7-flash', max_tokens:1, messages:[{role:'user',content:'1'}]}","auth_required":true},"sources":["https://docs.z.ai/guides/overview/pricing","https://docs.z.ai/guides/llm/glm-4.7","https://docs.z.ai/guides/llm/glm-4.7-flash","https://docs.z.ai/guides/llm/glm-4.5","https://docs.z.ai/guides/vlm/glm-4.6v","https://docs.z.ai/guides/overview/concept-param"],"verified_date":"2026-10-19","layers":["web-2026-10-19","paid-2026-10-19"],"notes":"From 2026-10-16, key type sets billing: a Standard key on the Coding Plan or Anthropic endpoint bills pay-as-you-go, and a Coding Plan key is for officially supported coding tools only. Zero-X must use Standard keys. Reasoning: glm-5.3 and 5.3-flash force thinking. GLM-4.5-Flash has a thinking.type toggle."}},{"provider":"zai","model_id":"glm-4.7-flash","context_window":200000,"max_output_tokens":128000,"supports_tools":true,"status":"new","record":{"notes":"Docs say 200K context / 128K max output. 30B-class model, thinking mode available. Free. Its own guide page is gone (only the GLM-4.7 page tab remains), so it may be retired."}},{"provider":"zai","model_id":"glm-4.5-flash","context_window":128000,"max_output_tokens":96000,"supports_tools":true,"status":"new","record":{"notes":"Docs say 128K / 96K. Still 'Free' on Z.ai pricing, but sister platform BigModel retired it on 2026-01-30 and routes it to GLM-4.7-Flash. Treat it as an alias."}},{"provider":"zai","model_id":"glm-4.6v-flash","context_window":128000,"status":"rejected","notes":"tool calling not published","record":{"notes":"Vision model (video/image/text/file in). 128K context. Max output isn't shown on Z.ai; BigModel lists 32K."}},{"provider":"zai-web","display_name":"Z.ai Web","status":"excluded","excluded_reason":"Consumer web session that needs a CAPTCHA per request.","notes":"Consumer web session that needs a CAPTCHA per request.","record":{"id":"zai-web","name":"Z.ai Web","kind":"other","free_status":"excluded_evasion","base_url":"https://chat.z.ai/","api_shape":"custom","auth":"cookie","signup":"chat.z.ai localStorage 'token'.","limits":{},"excluded_reason":"Consumer web session that needs a CAPTCHA per request.","health_probe":{"auth_required":true},"sources":[],"layers":["omniroute-catalog"],"notes":"OmniRoute handles the per-request CAPTCHA through its browser transport. subscriptionRisk (webCookie). No caller tools."}},{"provider":"zai-web","model_id":"glm-5.3-flash","supp